sequenceDiagram
  participant Drv as molt driver
  participant Dut as odc-device-*
  participant Wan as cellular or eth WAN
  participant Vpn as vpn.wireguard / openvpn
  participant Srv as hexa-five

  Drv->>Dut: apply VPN-only fixture
  Dut->>Wan: ensure upstream ready
  Drv->>Vpn: graph.components.start vpn_lab
  Vpn->>Srv: handshake peer
  Srv-->>Vpn: tunnel up
  Vpn-->>Drv: TransportBinding ip_ready
  Drv->>Srv: peer list shows DUT
  Note over Dut: assert no mav extender / rtsp running
  Drv->>Vpn: disconnect then reconnect
